---
permalink: /feed.json
layout: false
---
{#-
  JSON Feed 1.1 (P1.10). The 20 newest posts, absolute URLs.

  Written by a template, not by the RSS plugin (PLAN §3, line /feed.json).
  The plugin's json virtual template is not used (and adding feedPlugin
  to the config would also collide with this template's /feed.json… it
  only collides if pointed here, but PLAN says: template, not plugin).

  Every interpolated JSON value goes through the `jsonld` filter
  (JSON.stringify, registered in eleventy.config.js) — no hand-written
  JSON (CLAUDE.md). Items are accumulated as JSON strings and joined;
  the `jsonld` filter is what makes object/array values (tags) safe.

  `| safe` IS MANDATORY on every `| jsonld` interpolation below. Nunjucks
  autoescapes `{{ }}`, so without it the build shipped `&quot;title&quot;` and
  JSON.parse on /feed.json failed outright. This is the same class of bug
  as the one that shipped in jsonld.njk (see docs/SEO.md) — grep for `| jsonld`
  without `| safe` before declaring this feed done.

  JSON Feed 1.1 field names are exact and case-sensitive
  (https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1/): the feed-level author array is
  `authors` and each item's is `authors` too. Singular `author` is the
  deprecated 1.0 spelling; 1.1 readers are entitled to ignore it. This file
  shipped `author` (both levels) until the 2026-10-05 audit.
-#}
{%- set items = "" -%}
{%- for post in collections.posts.slice(0, 20) -%}
{#- date_modified: real revision when present, else publication (PLAN §4) -#}
{%- set modified = post.date.toISOString() -%}
{%- if post.data.updated -%}
{%- if post.data.updated is string -%}
{%- set modified = post.data.updated -%}
{%- else -%}
{%- set modified = post.data.updated.toISOString() -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{#- Item image: the post hero when present (r2: key -> public R2 host),
      else the branded 1200x630 default (P2.12). -#}
{%- set itemImage = site.url ~ "/assets/img/og-default.jpg" -%}
{%- if post.data.image and post.data.image.startsWith("http") -%}
{%- set itemImage = post.data.image -%}
{%- elif post.data.image -%}
{%- set itemImage = "https://img.itworktv.com/" ~ (post.data.image | replace("r2:", "")) -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- set item = {
  "id": site.url ~ post.url,
  "url": site.url ~ post.url,
  "title": post.data.title,
  "content_html": post.content,
  "summary": post.data.description,
  "date_published": post.date.toISOString(),
  "date_modified": modified,
  "image": itemImage,
  "tags": post.data.tags,
  "authors": [ { "name": site.author.name, "url": site.url ~ "/about/" } ]
} -%}
{%- set items = items ~ (item | jsonld | safe) ~ (", " if not loop.last else "") -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{
  "version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1",
  "title": {{ (site.title | default("")) | jsonld | safe }},
  "home_page_url": {{ (site.url ~ "/" | default("")) | jsonld | safe }},
  "feed_url": {{ (site.url ~ "/feed.json" | default("")) | jsonld | safe }},
  "description": {{ (site.description | default("")) | jsonld | safe }},
  "language": "en",
  "icon": {{ (site.url ~ "/assets/img/icon-192.png" | default("")) | jsonld | safe }},
  "image": {{ (site.url ~ "/assets/img/og-default.jpg" | default("")) | jsonld | safe }},
  "authors": [
    { "name": {{ (site.author.name | default("")) | jsonld | safe }},
      "url": {{ (site.url ~ "/about/" | default("")) | jsonld | safe }} }
  ],
  "items": [{{ items | safe }}]
}
